          "accessed": "2026-11-08"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "evaluation": {
    "metrics": {
      "value": "分类用 accuracy；分子设计报告 exact match 与 MACCS/Morgan/RDK 指纹相似度；数值任务报告 log RMSE、MAE、relative RMSE 和 RMSE。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2608.21504v1",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "scoring": {
      "value": "结构先解析再比对；数值任务计算误差；报告四提示下平均和标准差，不混为置信区间。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.21504",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "prompt_settings": {
      "value": "论文每任务用 GPT-5 Pro 生成 10 个模板并人工校验语义；报告评估取前 4 个通过验证的模板。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2608.21504v1",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "official_scripts": {
      "value": "src/cli.py 运行推理与评分；scripts/validate_data.py 检查数据及图像。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/einae-nd/ChemDIRT/main/README.md",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "comparability_warning": {
      "value": "不同任务指标无通用总分；图像转结构、逆合成与回归成绩不能同排。模型标签与API具体快照需区分。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.21504",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    }
